​Hi,

`loess`'s "smoothness" is controlled by span. Is that what you mean? Here's a short example.

ggplot(data=mtcars, aes(x = mpg, y = drat)) +
  geom_smooth(method="loess", size=1, formula = y ~ x, span = 2)  +
  theme_bw()

Cheers,
Roman​

